        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0050896"/>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115>Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of a stimulus. The process begins with detection of the stimulus by a cell and ends with a change in state or activity or the cell.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>cellular response to stimulus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
