        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>花芽分裂組織 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>Poaceae floret meristem (narrow)</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>ear floret meristem (narrow)</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
